"shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"g1xRzUV-aLjAE4mkdhLwBQ","review_id":"SiLWED56ZbyAcql-PIaxZQ","date":"2012-10-21T23:49:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9378234148025513,"text_excerpt":"Kermit Ruffins was playing and worth the trip! Local dive with tons of character, beer is cheap, crowd is music lovers of all ages, outside tables allow you to enjoy the sound without the crowds of the dance floor...bonus rice and beans served for the bar patrons, watch out for the hot sauce, I went a wee bit overboard!!! Cab it out there and bring a number to call when you want to hail to Quarter or your hotel as they are tough to come by,"},{"business_id":"g1xRzUV-aLjAE4mkdhLwBQ","review_id":"gv3_a_kESVkRuivlwqDeJg","date":"2009-10-21T00:34:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9356536865234375,"text_excerpt":"I also went on a Thursday night to hear Kermit Ruffins and the BBQ Swingers. Great vibe, very intimate place to hear them play, and really nice mix of people from all walks of life. My only issue is that I was hoping to hit the BBQ for dinner, and didn't realize they started serving so late. I would recommend eating a snack before coming here, so you can wait it out and taste the BBQ. I loved this place though, and would definitely come back the next time I am in New Orleans."},{"business_id":"g1xRzUV-aLjAE4mkdhLwBQ","review_id":"0a_Xpe3pLKEUCjAE0tXWag","date":"2010-04-21T16:01:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9348867535591125,"text_excerpt":"Vaughan's was an incredible experience. Eclectic mix of people, most of whom appeared to be locals. It's a small dark bar with cheap drinks and great music. We were here on a Thursday night to hear Kermit Ruffins and his band and they did not disappoint. The place was packed, but not so bad that we couldn't get drinks and tear up the dance floor. We met so many fun people here that we ended up staying all night - drinking heavily with the crowd and shoveling our faces with gumbo. It's places like this that make me want to live in new Orleans."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"g1xRzUV-aLjAE4mkdhLwBQ","photo_id":"1eNvhJav9wfeVyj6Wl2TPA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/1eNvhJav9wfeVyj6Wl2TPA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8167977333068848},{"business_id":"g1xRzUV-aLjAE4mkdhLwBQ","photo_id":"YqWkqOwdLskNeRopwQykiA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/YqWkqOwdLskNeRopwQykiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8165323734283447},{"business_id":"g1xRzUV-aLjAE4mkdhLwBQ","photo_id":"zdEd6nmuuuGdpyWCrtnoAQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/zdEd6nmuuuGdpyWCrtnoAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8133453130722046},{"business_id":"g1xRzUV-aLjAE4mkdhLwBQ","photo_id":"VICKUADf_XzIBH13CzchQA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VICKUADf_XzIBH13CzchQA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.737249493598938}]},"notebook_case":null}
